# UR Intelligence needs NO environment variables and NO shared API key.
#
# It is a static, frontend-only app. Every visitor pastes their own OpenRouter
# API key in the browser (https://openrouter.ai/settings/keys). The key is sent
# directly from the visitor's browser to OpenRouter and is never part of the
# build, the source code, or any server configuration.
#
# Do NOT add an OpenRouter key here or as a Vercel environment variable.
# Any VITE_* variable would be baked into the public JavaScript bundle.
